      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it's a solid start, very clear. \n\ncould you expand on this a bit more? i need a more detailed breakdown of the specific stages (prophase, metaphase, etc.) so the students can really grasp the mechanics of how the chromosomes move. \n\nalso, just a reminder—our tool's scoring is a bit low on this first draft because it's looking for those engagement markers we talked about. don't let me down with keyword stuffing, but try to make sure the guide feels structured and instructional so it actually helps them learn. can you do a deeper dive into those stages?",
